; Store a preposition in the phrase slots
;
; Counts the prepositions of the phrase in ActionFlag ($757A, cleared when a
; phrase record is started by #R$75A0): the third is refused (RejectPhrase,
; #R$7924). Otherwise the word is stored in the first free of the two
; preposition slots at the start of ActionSlots ($757B, $757D) by #R$780C.
; .
; Preposition-like words are class 7 (on, with, to...) and class 1 (in, into),
; which #R$7795 reads.
;
; BC Word (class nibble and dictionary offset)
; O:HL After the stored word (#R$780C)
@label=StorePreposition
c$781C LD HL,$757A   ; ActionFlag
 $781F INC (HL)      ; one more preposition
 $7820 LD A,(HL)     ;
@isub=CP MAX_PREPOSITIONS
 $7821 CP $03        ;
 $7823 JP NC,$7924   ; a third one: reject the phrase
 $7826 LD HL,$757B   ; ActionSlots: the two preposition slots
 $7829 JR $780C      ; StoreWordInPair
